When exporting dashboard resources, the axes need to be in a consistent order so the output is deterministic across multiple exports. The convertCellView function builds a chart struct with an Axes slice that should be sorted before returning. I'll add a sort.Slice call on ch.Axes right before the return statement, sorting by the Name field to ensure stable ordering.

