The Modal-body class has flex-basis set to 0 which causes content expansion issues in IE11. IE11 has known bugs with flex-basis: 0 that prevent child content from properly sizing and expanding the modal container. Removing this declaration while keeping flex-grow: 1 allows the modal body to grow and contain its content correctly in IE11 without affecting modern browser behavior.

