Recapping the work:

Fixed multiple Internet Explorer 11 compatibility issues across JavaScript and CSS code. Replaced NodeList.forEach with array conversion in the markdown renderer, added optional chaining for DOM element method calls in the drawer component, and switched to a more compatible object type check in the helper utilities. Removed a flexbox declaration in modal styles that prevented proper content expansion in IE11.

This work addresses multiple functional improvements and bug fixes across the component library. The Select component requires enhanced clearable behavior with a configurable reset value to support different use cases where clearing should reset to something other than an empty string. The picker component has a logic inversion preventing proper selection handling when multiple selection is disabled. The video renderer needs a fix for HLS stream playback due to incorrect module import syntax. Additionally, project documentation should be updated with complete licensing information and build status badges for better visibility.

