I need to go through and add optional markers to all these properties and parameters. Starting with the class properties, I'll make baseSpacingTop, baseSpacingBottom, baseSpacingLeft, and baseSpacingRight optional since they default to 0. Then replaceLinefeeds, verticalTextRotation, ignoreClippedStringSize, ignoreStringSize, textWidthPadding, lastValue, and cacheEnabled all need the optional marker based on their documented defaults.

The implicitly defined variables section also needs attention - textDirection, labelPadding, overflow, clipped, wrap, border, background, horizontal, and all the spacing and style properties should be optional since they're not required to construct a valid text shape.

For the constructor, I need to make the same changes to the parameters. The first two parameters value and bounds should stay required since they're fundamental to creating a text shape, but everything from align through textDirection can be optional. This will match the actual mxGraph behavior where you can create a text shape with just a value and bounds, letting all the styling fall back to defaults.

