Starting with the dependency updates. The current electron-chromedriver and electron-mksnapshot are both at version 5, but I need to bump them up to version 9 to support the new ELECTRON_CUSTOM_VERSION functionality. I'll update script/package.json to change electron-chromedriver from ^5.0.0 to ^9.0.0 and electron-mksnapshot from ^5.0.0 to ^9.0.2. This will naturally pull in a bunch of new transitive dependencies that will show up in script/package-lock.json, including packages like @electron/get, cacheable-request, and various others that the newer versions depend on.

