[MarcoMandar/Eliza: Conversational Agent for Twitter and Discord]

Update the project documentation to improve clarity and add a Chinese language version for international users. Fix the Anthropic API key loading logic in the CLI to properly check for both ANTHROPIC_API_KEY and CLAUDE_API_KEY environment variables. Update the Grok model configuration to use the correct model name "grok-beta" instead of "grok-2-beta" and modify the generation logic to initialize Grok through the OpenAI-compatible API endpoint rather than the Groq provider. These changes span README.md, README_CN.md, core/src/cli/index.ts, core/src/core/generation.ts, and core/src/core/models.ts.

