Added support for OpenAI's December 2024 model releases by introducing O1 and O1Mini constants and updating the default model to GPT4o. Created a new Developer role constant to handle o1 model prompt requirements. Modified the example application to accept a configurable model parameter and implemented logic to route messages differently based on the selected model type. Updated API key validation to check access against the specified model rather than a hardcoded value.
